cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Smoke Monkey"
abstract: >-
  A chat LLM platform with super memory and dynamic visual widgets. Hybrid
  RAG (pgvector + Postgres FTS, RRF fusion, reranking, HyDE, multi-query),
  agentic query routing, durable conversation memory, and live canvas
  visualizations rendered inside the chat.
